  "headline": "MPR To Verify Qualifications Of Prabowo’s Vice President Candidates",
  "seoTitle": "MPR Verifies Amran Sulaiman And Sugiono Vice President…",
  "metaDescription": "The MPR schedules a factual verification of vice presidential candidates Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono, requiring them to sign non-withdrawal commitments.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The MPR has scheduled factual verification for vice presidential candidates Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono on November 25-26, 2026.",
    "Candidates will be required to sign a commitment statement pledging they will not withdraw from the selection process.",
    "The verification process includes an official review of candidate documentation, including educational diplomas."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has officially nominated Minister of Agriculture Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono as candidates for the vice presidential position. In response, the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) has initiated a formal verification process to ensure all administrative requirements are met. The verification is set to take place over two days, during which candidates will be required to formally sign a commitment declaring their intent to remain in the race and not withdraw. This follows reports that the President considered several alternative candidates before finalizing these two nominations. Concurrently, academic institutions are assisting with the review of educational credentials, such as diplomas. Despite the ongoing nomination process, officials noted that Amran Sulaiman continues to carry out his ministerial duties, focusing on agricultural support and farmer welfare initiatives.",
